  enemyName: Gooper
  enemyDescription: A fully liquid creature capabale of hardening, softening and changing shape, the Gooper's a tricky enemy to deal with. Attacking with balls of goo their main objective is covering a man in slime until they're rendered immobile. It's at this point the Gooper will attach themselves to the man's crotch and replenish their body.
